    {
      "text": "A forest plot of the proportion (%) of participants with fever after TBST, grouped by test: C-Tb 2.6% (three studies), C-TST 0.0% (two studies with no events) and DST 2.7% (six studies, 0.0% to 7.0%). The overall random-effects pooled proportion is 2.6% (2.0–3.4) across 2478 participants.",
